{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-32","kind":"proposition","title":"弦切角定理","englishTitle":"If a straight line touch a circle, and from the point of contact there be drawn across, in the circle, a straight line cutting the circle, the angles which it makes with the tangent will be equal to the angles in the alternate segments of the circle.","book":3,"number":32,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":32,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","contentId":"euclid-3-32","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9b2a41d267de71e06ccf06f6b3ee6a1e63669d2bdd1831db32b24df139644791","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-32.statement","euclid-3-32.construction.1","euclid-3-32.construction.2","euclid-3-32.proof.1","euclid-3-32.proof.2","euclid-3-32.proof.3","euclid-3-32.proof.4","euclid-3-32.construction.3","euclid-3-32.proof.5","euclid-3-32.proof.6","euclid-3-32.conclusion","euclid-3-32.historical.1","euclid-3-32.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-32.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2d145cb36965e59813eccb62a7ae8b1a8026770a15de7ec5778182728b7ec05","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line touch a circle, and from the point of contact there be drawn across, in the circle, a straight line cutting the circle, the angles which it makes with the tangent will be equal to the angles in the alternate segments of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线触碰一个圆,并且从接触点画出横跨圆的直线,则它与正切线的角等于圆的交替部分中的角度。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直线切圜从切界任作直线割圜为两分分内各任为负圜角其切线与割线所作两角与两负圜角交互相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从切线边界画一条直线的切圆。圆被分为两分钟，每个角都是负圆角。由切线和两个负圆角绘制的切线与两个角相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4417b0575617258768bbb3bdefd3a4ace8e6625ba04ef859735c563612aa06b4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a straight line EF touch the circle ABCD at the point B, and from the point B let there be drawn across, in the circle ABCD, a straight line BD cutting it; I say that the angles which BD makes with the tangent EF will be equal to the angles in the alternate segments of the circle, that is, that the angle FBD is equal to the angle constructed in the segment BAD, and the angle EBD is equal to the angle constructed in the segment DCB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线EF触摸ABCD点的圆圈B,则在ABCD点划过,在ABCD点划过一条直线BD线,截断这条线;我说,BD点与正切EF点的角等于圆圈各段的角,即FBD点等于在BAD点构造的角,而EBD点等于在DCB点构造的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"18fd98d7ae9ed8d3087d817285996240586f6ee5589132d1486a323e6d7a0b60","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let BA be drawn from B at right angles to EF, let a point C be taken at random on the circumference BD, and let AD, DC, CB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA从直角的B抽到EF,BD随机抽到C,AD、DC、CB接通。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88c22d1d1706f2b8437f1b6852a721689bd618872b277be8b2fccb2f62e10be1","citations":["euclid-3-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since a straight line EF touches the circle ABCD at B, and BA has been drawn from the point of contact at right angles to the tangent, the centre of the circle ABCD is on BA. [[III. 19](/principles/euclid-3-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,由于一条直线EF直线接ABCD,B,BA是从直角接触点到切线的接触点抽取,ABCD圆的中心在BA。 [[III. 19](/principles/euclid-3-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45a1a578df164818a75fcea04692a8184fe5e62a52bd17895b95b9fb100762ce","citations":["euclid-3-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BA is a diameter of the circle ABCD; therefore the angle ADB, being an angle in a semicircle, is right. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BA是ABCD圆的直径;因此,ADB角是半圆形的一个角度,是正确的。 [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"168561c0ab307cb7926e55562bb8d1975d88fa217244dfb503f3c5ddc1340418","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the remaining angles BAD, ABD are equal to one right angle. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余的BAD,ABD角度等于1,直角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a02c178795edabfc325b8a42ecfa5918ba4190ef9a5168127dfe494a0ad92d38","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ABF is also right; therefore the angle ABF is equal to the angles BAD, ABD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABF角度也是对的,因此ABF角度等于BAD,ABD角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7e9439074afba6de689f4cc6b6811152d058bfcfad3e1b1e5496c0682ca3ac6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle ABD be subtracted from each; therefore the angle DBF which remains is equal to the angle BAD in the alternate segment of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将每个角的ABD减掉;因此,所剩角的DBF等于圆的交替段的角BAD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc235bccf7110585a478477c95eab32924e8557ba6b02a8e98dccc96f7c672a4","citations":["euclid-3-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, since ABCD is a quadrilateral in a circle, its opposite angles are equal to two right angles. [[III. 22](/principles/euclid-3-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,由于ABCD是圆形中的四边形,其相反的角度等于两个直角。 [[III. 22](/principles/euclid-3-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80c1725a16a3fda8d9de17f1cef2f658363d7ded570262e59e373e31d23679fa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles DBF, DBE are also equal to two right angles; therefore the angles DBF, DBE are equal to the angles BAD, BCD, of which the angle BAD was proved equal to the angle DBF; therefore the angle DBE which remains is equal to the angle DCB in the alternate segment DCB of the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DBF、DBE角度也等于两个直角;因此,DBF、DBE角度等于BAD、BCD角度,其中BAD角度被证明等于DBF角度;因此,DBE角度仍然等于圆圈中替代部分DCB的DCB角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2e8add0933a6aa625a3be2fa51d752cf9639c41ba91495448eac7a56343388f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"直线切圜从切界任作直线割圜为两分分内各任为负圜角其切线与割线所作两角与两负圜角交互相等解曰甲乙线切丙丁戊圜于丙从丙任作丙戊直线割圜为两分两分内任作丙丁戊丙庚戊两负圜角题言甲丙戊角与丙庚戊角乙丙戊角与丙丁戊角交互相等先论割圜线过心者曰如前图甲丙戊乙丙戊两皆直角〈一卷十八〉而丙庚戊丙丁戊两负半圜角亦皆直角〈本篇卅一〉则交互相等后论割圜线不过心者曰如后图试作丙己过心直线次作戊己线相联其己丙为甲乙之垂线〈一卷十八〉而丙戊己为直角〈本篇卅一〉即戊丙己戊己丙两角并等于一直角亦等于甲丙己角矣此两率者各减同用之戊丙己角即所存戊己丙与甲丙戊等也夫戊己丙与丙庚戊元等〈本卷廿一〉则甲丙戊与丙庚戊交互相等又丙丁戊庚四边形之丙丁戊丙庚戊两对角并等两直角〈本篇〉〈廿二〉而甲丙戊乙丙戊两交角亦等两直角〈一卷十三〉此二率者各减一相等之甲丙戊丙庚戊则所存丙丁戊乙丙戊亦交互相等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从切线边界画一条直线的切圆。圆被分为两分钟，这两分钟中的每一个都是负圆角。由切线和两个负圆角形成的两个角交替相等。说明如下：甲乙 线切线，丙丁戊 圆在 丙，从 丙 到 丙戊 画一条线，并在两部分之间画一个圆。在 丙丁戊丙庚戊 内，画两个负圆角。命题：命题说明：甲丙戊 角和 丙庚戊 角，乙丙戊 角和 丙丁戊 角交替相等。首先，我们讨论如何通过中心切圆线：如前图所示，甲丙戊乙丙戊 均为直角 〈一卷十八〉，丙庚戊丙丁戊 两个负半圆角 〈一卷十八〉 也为直角。〈本篇卅一〉 然后交替相等。稍后，当讨论如何切不在中心的圆时，如下图所示。尝试通过 丙己 画一条直线，然后连接 戊己 为一条线，并且 己丙 垂直于 甲乙。 垂直于 甲乙。002 和 丙戊己 为直角；〈本篇卅一〉 等于两个 戊丙己戊己丙 角的和，也等于 甲丙己。这两个比各减去相同的 戊丙己 角，等于储存的 戊己丙 和 甲丙戊。戊己丙 和 丙庚戊 相等。如果 〈本卷廿一〉，那么 甲丙戊 和 丙庚戊 交替相等，丙丁戊庚 和 丙丁戊丙庚戊 的两个对角之和 〈本篇〉〈廿二〉 甲丙戊乙丙戊 和 甲丙戊乙丙戊 也等于两个直角。〈一卷十三〉 从这两个比中各减去一个。如果 甲丙戊丙庚戊 相等，则 丙丁戊乙丙戊 也彼此相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-32.source","contentId":"euclid-3-32","revisionId":"euclid-3-32@raw-9b2a41d267de71e0","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de95a13c7d7eb19a97a08c46a2a111a9f24af7ee880525666df91c27e65ff2f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-19:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-32.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-19","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"III. 19"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-32.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"III. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-32.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-32.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.32/","sourceLabel":"III. 22"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-33:euclid-3-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-33","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-33.proof.6","euclid-3-33.proof.19"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.33","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.33/","sourceLabel":"III. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-34:euclid-3-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-34.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.34/","sourceLabel":"III. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-3-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-2.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"III. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-10:euclid-3-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-10.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"III. 32"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-19:explicit","id":"euclid-3-19","book":3,"number":19,"kind":"proposition","title":"直线切圆圆内作切线之垂线则圆心必在垂线之内","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-31:explicit","id":"euclid-3-31","book":3,"number":31,"kind":"proposition","title":"半圆所对的圆周角是直角","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-1-32:explicit","id":"euclid-1-32","book":1,"number":32,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形内角和与外角定理","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-32:euclid-3-22:explicit","id":"euclid-3-22","book":3,"number":22,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆内接四边形的对角互补","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-33:euclid-3-32:explicit","id":"euclid-3-33","book":3,"number":33,"kind":"proposition","title":"一线上求作圆分而负圆分角与所设直线角等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-34:euclid-3-32:explicit","id":"euclid-3-34","book":3,"number":34,"kind":"proposition","title":"设圆求割一分而负圆分角与所设直线角等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-2:euclid-3-32:explicit","id":"euclid-4-2","book":4,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"在圆内作与给定三角形相似的三角形","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-10:euclid-3-32:explicit","id":"euclid-4-10","book":4,"number":10,"kind":"proposition","title":"黄金三角形的尺规构造","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
